#: website/public/showcase/notion/index.html:7
msgctxt "page:showcase/notion/index.html"
msgid ""
"Follow Notion's clipboard API through Electron's preload, IPC wrappers and "
"main process, with short code excerpts and a look at its rich clipboard "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Segui l'API degli appunti di Notion attraverso il precarico di Electron, i "
